{"data": [{"author_id": "2116854702214103040", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:01:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122736882429628658"], "id": "2122736882429628658", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The repository jingyaogong/minimind is trending on GitHub daily, featuring a project that trains a 64M-parameter LLM from scratch in just two hours.\n\nhttps://t.co/8j1EIkTAuC", "url": "https://x.com/AIFutureWire/status/2122736882429628658"}, {"author_id": "2009320756346540032", "created_at": "2026-11-17T02:10:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122512795942216122"], "id": "2122512795942216122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚀 Trending on GitHub\nhttps://t.co/G68XFBiEPL by jackulau\n⭐ 68 stars\n🧠 Logs every prompt, tool call, file edit and dollar cost from your Claude Code / Codex sessions.\nhttps://t.co/AjbAsxJy8a\n📬 Got your own open-source repo? List it at https://t.co/fC6t1hihje\n#GenAI #OpenSource", "url": "https://x.com/TheArthiAI/status/2122512795942216122"}, {"author_id": "2009320756346540032", "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:45:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122778289488212454"], "id": "2122778289488212454", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚀 Trending on GitHub\n9RouterX by yanstd888\n⭐ 249 stars\n🧠 A single-binary tool that routes your AI coding assistant across 155 providers and 248 free models, cutting token costs 20-40%.\nhttps://t.co/uDUPMkTjGT\n📬 Got your own open-source repo? List it at https://t.co/fC6t1hihje", "url": "https://x.com/TheArthiAI/status/2122778289488212454"}, {"author_id": "2009320756346540032", "created_at": "2026-11-17T15:47:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122718192426721583"], "id": "2122718192426721583", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚀 Trending on GitHub\ninference-optimisation-skill by sybil-solutions\n⭐ 681 stars\n🧠 An agent skill that makes local LLMs run faster, tuned step by step instead of guessed at.\nhttps://t.co/FJ8Da5T815\n📬 Got your own open-source repo? List it at https://t.co/fC6t1hihje\n#GenAI", "url": "https://x.com/TheArthiAI/status/2122718192426721583"}, {"author_id": "2009320756346540032", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:45:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122838487741436387"], "id": "2122838487741436387", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚀 Trending on GitHub\nstitch-skills by google-labs-code\n⭐ 10,084 (350 stars today)\n🧠 An open library of \"Agent Skills\" that works across Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Cursor and Antigravity, instead of being locked to one tool.\nhttps://t.co/nXKgnVmvBY\n📬 Got your own open-source", "url": "https://x.com/TheArthiAI/status/2122838487741436387"}, {"author_id": "2388409525", "created_at": "2026-11-17T20:53:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122795164192460863"], "id": "2122795164192460863", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 68, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "github trending is basically all agent harnesses now, every other repo is skills memory planning security wrappers. half of them will be dead by january, but i still read the memory ones because storing context is the part that actually eats my week", "url": "https://x.com/fialaerik/status/2122795164192460863"}, {"author_id": "2070088758192746497", "created_at": "2026-11-17T11:37:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122655362587173050"], "id": "2122655362587173050", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "t3 code crossed 60k github stars while theo was on vacation, and it's still adding over 1k a day. the repo did not know he was out of office.", "url": "https://x.com/sspzoax/status/2122655362587173050"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122717582587510784", "3_2122717585800314880"]}, "author_id": "1392909753676795904", "created_at": "2026-11-17T15:44:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122717588530806917"], "id": "2122717588530806917", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 1285, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "AG-UI made #1 GitHub Trending!\n\nThe open protocol for how agents talk to users.\nAdopted by AWS, Google, Microsoft and more.\n\n⏬ 8.7M npm/PyPI downloads/week\n⭐ 20,000 stars\n🍴 2.1k forks\n\nGive any agent streaming, shared state, generative UI and human-in-the-loop!\n\nRepo below https://t.co/UuaMxfPxrI", "url": "https://x.com/CopilotKit/status/2122717588530806917"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122646752285306880"]}, "author_id": "1616070554712440833", "created_at": "2026-11-17T11:03:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122646758627180707"], "id": "2122646758627180707", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 1000, "like_count": 55, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 35}, "text": "🚨 Anthropic has officially opened its Claude Skills collection on GitHub!\n\nA free, open-source library packed with ready-to-use Skills for:\n\n→ Frontend &amp; UI design\n→ Building AI agents\n→ Software development\n→ Document generation\n→ And much more.\n\nCompletely FREE to explore https://t.co/rBs1ZydT0r", "url": "https://x.com/Noah_Ai_88/status/2122646758627180707"}, {"author_id": "2110773454391922691", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:53:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122764967787008062"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 281, "start": 258, "url": "https://t.co/6xI3vEkjCA"}]}, "id": "2122764967787008062", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122122979962142898", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Anthropic is taking on ugly AI slides.\n\nIts official PowerPoint skill tells Claude to design for the deck’s purpose, check every slide visually, and use charts you can still edit in PowerPoint.\n\nIt’s part of Anthropic’s skills repo—now at 197K GitHub stars. https://t.co/6xI3vEkjCA", "url": "https://x.com/itsmaxma/status/2122764967787008062"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122698261329010689"]}, "author_id": "1970136852113043456", "created_at": "2026-11-17T14:28:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122698278915674185"], "id": "2122698278915674185", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "73,011 GitHub stars are piling onto ZhuLinsen/daily_stock_analysis for a reason. It handles multi-market data, real-time news aggregation, and automated alerts using zero-cost scheduled runs. Point your local LLM at the repo and stop renting institutional dashboards.\n#OpenSo https://t.co/3IH1XrihRY", "url": "https://x.com/GalYouXiku/status/2122698278915674185"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122586353225568256"]}, "author_id": "1818381581897412608", "created_at": "2026-11-17T10:03:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122631582234353711"], "id": "2122631582234353711", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 116, "impression_count": 4959, "like_count": 93, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 52, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "A million-token context window still doesn't give Claude Code a map of your codebase.\n\nThis is something more AI engineers should be paying attention to.\n\nAn agent can read thousands of lines of source code and still spend dozens of tool calls figuring out which function calls https://t.co/pAqjl6zfLy", "url": "https://x.com/techNmak/status/2122631582234353711"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122759179819421696"]}, "author_id": "137018004", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:30:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122759183191732672"], "id": "2122759183191732672", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A dev handed Claude Code a blank repo. 57 min later: one todo app, running natively on web, macOS AND iOS. No webview. 20KB runtime vs React's 81KB. The tool: Expo's Exact, 2 weeks old, already past 4,500 GitHub stars. Built once → shipped everywhere. Still building things 3x? https://t.co/qKobnYuGtp", "url": "https://x.com/TOP84/status/2122759183191732672"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122682652432228353"]}, "author_id": "19628766", "created_at": "2026-11-17T13:25:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122682655158550736"], "id": "2122682655158550736", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 2538, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Agent Substrate tackles the cost of keeping agents idle on Kubernetes.\n\nContributed by Google to the CNCF, it combines:\n\n&gt; gVisor or microVM sandboxes per agent\n&gt; Snapshots between turns, restored on demand\n&gt; API keys injected by a gateway outside the sandbox\n\nState survives, https://t.co/AoYD3pm3a9", "url": "https://x.com/DataChaz/status/2122682655158550736"}, {"author_id": "43164976", "created_at": "2026-11-17T11:25:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122652425228026112"], "id": "2122652425228026112", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 62, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "กูเกิลปล่อย PaperOrchestra โอเพนซอร์ส — ทีม AI agent 5 ตัวช่วยเขียนเปเปอร์วิจัยให้เสร็จเป็นไฟล์ LaTeX ส่งประชุมได้เอง\n\nrepo google-research/paper-orchestra สัญญา Apache-2.0 ขึ้น GitHub Trending อันดับ 12 วันนี้ +313 ดาว รวม 2,066 ดาว (GitHub API 17 พ.ย. 2569)\n\nในทีมมี agent", "url": "https://x.com/maxnetlove007/status/2122652425228026112"}, {"author_id": "2043337996297011200", "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:42:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122732016198385874"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 302, "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/pxAs9mmcRU"}]}, "id": "2122732016198385874", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122458476345717169", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Why is an open-source repo gaining 1,000+ GitHub stars a day while multi-billion dollar AI labs ship native apps? 📈👇\n\nBecause developers refuse to get locked into a single model vendor 🔒\n\nt3code lets you: \n• Control Claude Code, Codex, Cursor &amp; Antigravity in one unified UI https://t.co/pxAs9mmcRU", "url": "https://x.com/carelessdept/status/2122732016198385874"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122644356641521664"]}, "author_id": "2483854566", "created_at": "2026-11-17T10:54:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122644451558330421"], "id": "2122644451558330421", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "People are raising+50M$ dollars for this. If I connect the below with Postgres + Claude API + Okara / Any other Lead gen tool, that's it.\n\nOpen-sourced Nodus CRM: an AI CRM where agents do the work. Click \"Use AI\" on a task and get a finished proposal, email or deck built from https://t.co/njuAqJL0Tl", "url": "https://x.com/RShakthiguru/status/2122644451558330421"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122801575982981120"]}, "author_id": "1738431145564573696", "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:18:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122801587647283428"], "id": "2122801587647283428", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 594, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "🚨 Someone built a FREE Claude skills library with 30K+ GitHub stars.\n\nIt's packed with tools that can turn Claude into an entire AI workforce.\n\nHere's what you get:\n\n→ Hundreds of ready-to-use skills and AI agents.\n→ Expert personas: CTO, senior architect, security auditor, https://t.co/rSAw9xs8HA", "url": "https://x.com/rakib_hossen_ai/status/2122801587647283428"}, {"author_id": "1908014421538123779", "created_at": "2026-11-17T13:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122676125017030846"], "id": "2122676125017030846", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 160, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Microsoft\nopen-sourced\na plugin called\nTokenEconomizer\n\nthe repo is already\npast 6,700\nGitHub stars\n\nit does not ask you\nto switch models\nor buy another API\n\non SWE-Bench\nthey tested\n5 agent\nand model combos\n\naverage cost fell\nbetween 18.4%\nand 30.9%\n\nit keeps what\nthe agent", "url": "https://x.com/bb833dong/status/2122676125017030846"}, {"author_id": "1908014421538123779", "created_at": "2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122789372978225426"], "id": "2122789372978225426", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ApkStart lets you\ndouble-click\nan APK on Windows\nand get a desktop\nicon\n\nit landed on\nthe Trendshift\ndaily list\n\nthe repo only\nshowed up\nin late October\n\nit already has\n4.7K\nGitHub stars\n\nand shipped\n4 versions\nin one recent day\n\neach app opens\nin its own\ntall window\n\nyou can", "url": "https://x.com/bb833dong/status/2122789372978225426"}, {"author_id": "2113269493673902080", "created_at": "2026-11-17T01:32:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122503228382474300"], "id": "2122503228382474300", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 62, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Stop updating your Windows apps one by one.\nBrowser. Video player. Code editor. Another installer, another update window.\n​UniGetUI puts software installation and updates into one interface—without making you memorize terminal commands.\nIt’s a free, open-source Windows app with", "url": "https://x.com/Bumingsuoyi666/status/2122503228382474300"}, {"author_id": "1908014421538123779", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122834672954531892"], "id": "2122834672954531892", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "DiscImageStudio\nburns a photo\ninto the data\nof a disc\nso the pattern\nis visible\non the surface\n\nit landed on\nthe Trendshift\ndaily list\n\nthe repo started\nat the end\nof August\n\nit already has\nmore than\n10,000\nGitHub stars\n\nversion 1.6.0\ncame out\non November 15,\na little over\na week", "url": "https://x.com/bb833dong/status/2122834672954531892"}, {"author_id": "1881173355921108992", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:16:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122740753688400120"], "id": "2122740753688400120", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 132, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "5 repos topped GitHub Trending today, and all 5 are agent tooling. I checked each repo page, stars and license as of 01:15 Nov 18.\n\n1. Univer, 28.8k stars, Apache-2.0: AI office SDK, sheets, docs and slides, so agents edit inside real documents.\n2. AG-UI, 19.9k stars, MIT:", "url": "https://x.com/harden_369741/status/2122740753688400120"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122541888444239872"]}, "author_id": "1837960126239854592", "created_at": "2026-11-17T04:06:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122541890109362407